OL,3,GNEWSAMedicinal cannabis worth #35k
OL,4,Astolen in armed robbery
OL,5,
OL,6,FMedicinal cannabis products worth about
OL,7,F#35,000 were stolen in what police
OL,8,Fbelieve was an armed robbery on the A34
OL,9,Fnear Newbury.
OL,11,FA delivery driver parked a Mercedes
OL,12,FSprinter van in a layby on the
OL,13,Fsouthbound stretch, near the East
OL,14,FIlsley Interchange, at about 21:40 GMT
OL,15,Fon Friday.
OL,17,FAn offender assaulted the driver and
OL,18,Fthreatened him with what is believed to
OL,19,Fbe a firearm before stealing the
OL,20,Fproducts, including CBD oil, CBD
OL,21,Fpastilles and vape cartridges, before
OL,22,Fleaving.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
